{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>要去日本淺草體驗和服或和服，Chiikawa 粉絲千萬不要錯過！淺草熱門和服租借店浅草さわだ屋（Asakusa Sawadaya）將Chiikawa小可愛們變成浴衣啊～職員將和服腰帶精心摺出 Chiikawa 各個角色的招牌耳朵與輪廓，背面拍照打卡超好看，大家更可加購髮型套餐，幫大家設計專屬髮型，搭配同色系和服與精緻蕾絲配飾，帶公仔去打卡充滿紀念價值！另外還有賽蓮和島二郎款式，緊貼潮流！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179061125200849133_5506617286aba8f344c7a8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179061125352186937_10136437106aba8f35c8a5e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179061125523792004_21281781446aba8f378a2d9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179061125717339716_17932474046aba8f3984658.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179061125895571124_18258495966aba8f3b664cd.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17906112612879928_20635004486aba8f3d9d108.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179061126299328209_10724556526aba8f3f54374.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T16:19:44.817464+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":268,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}